  "Slightly modify your UI to ensure more consistent demos. This is only recommended for demo purposes. In most cases, you can run \"Antigravity: Start Demo Mode\" and \"Antigravity: Stop Demo Mode\" to control this switch and update your ~/.gemini/antigravity data directory.": "微调界面以获得更一致的演示效果。仅建议用于演示目的。多数情况下可运行“Antigravity: Start Demo Mode”和“Antigravity: Stop Demo Mode”来控制此开关，并更新 ~/.gemini/antigravity 数据目录。",
  "Enforce settings that prevent the agent from autonomously running targeted exploits and require human review for all agent actions. Visit antigravity.google/docs/strict-mode for details.": "强制阻止智能体自主执行针对性漏洞利用，并要求对所有智能体操作进行人工审核。详情请访问 antigravity.google/docs/strict-mode。",
  "Allow the agent to automatically view and edit files outside the current workspace. Use with caution: this gives the agent access to additional potentially-relevant information, but also allows the agent to access credential files, secrets, and other files outside of the workspace that could be targeted in prompt injection attacks or other exploits by malicious actors.": "允许智能体自动查看并编辑当前工作区之外的文件。请谨慎使用：这会为智能体提供额外的潜在相关信息，但也会让智能体访问凭据文件、密钥及工作区之外的其他文件，这些文件可能成为恶意行为者提示注入攻击或其他利用手段的目标。",
  "When running commands, the agent will try to use this address, and fall back to the \"connector.host.featureDefault\" host if not defined. Note: hosts set here with auto-run enabled will have internet access restricted soon.": "运行命令时，智能体会尝试使用此地址；若未定义则回退到“connector.host.featureDefault”主机。注意：在此处启用了自动运行的主机，其互联网访问将很快受到限制。",
  "Play a sound when your action is needed or the agent finishes.": "当需要你操作或智能体完成时播放声音。",
  "Show system notifications when your action is needed or the agent finishes.": "当需要你操作或智能体完成时显示系统通知。",
  "Open files in the background if the agent creates or edits them": "智能体创建或编辑文件时在后台打开",
  "Let the agent use browser tools to open URLs, read web pages, and interact with browser content. This gives the agent access to important (and often critical) knowledge and methods of validation, but any browser integration does increase exposure to external malicious parties for security exploits.": "允许智能体使用浏览器工具打开 URL、读取网页并与浏览器内容交互。这使智能体能够获取重要（且往往关键）的知识与验证手段，但任何浏览器集成都会增加遭受外部恶意方安全利用的风险。",
  "Path to the Chrome/Chromium executable. Leave empty for auto-detection.": "Chrome/Chromium 可执行文件路径。留空则自动检测。",
  "Absolute path to the Chrome/Chromium executable": "Chrome/Chromium 可执行文件的绝对路径",
  "Custom path for the browser user profile directory. Leave empty for default (~/.gemini/antigravity-browser-profile).": "浏览器用户配置目录的自定义路径。留空则使用默认值（~/.gemini/antigravity-browser-profile）。",
  "Browser CDP Port": "浏览器 CDP 端口",
  "Port number for Chrome DevTools Protocol remote debugging. Leave empty for default (9222).": "Chrome DevTools Protocol 远程调试的端口号。留空则使用默认值（9222）。",
  "Git-on-Borg repository used when creating a new Cog workspace from your initial prompt (e.g., chromium/src or android/platform/superproject).": "根据初始提示词创建新的 Cog 工作区时所使用的 Git-on-Borg 仓库（例如 chromium/src 或 android/platform/superproject）。",
  "Give each Best of N fork its own clone of your Git repository instead of a copy-on-write overlay. Each fork is then a real repository, so commits it makes are kept when you choose it as the winner. Forks take longer to create, and the wait grows with the size of your repository. See go/jetski-best-of-n.": "让 Best of N 的每个分支拥有自己的 Git 仓库克隆，而不是写时复制覆盖层。这样每个分支都是真实仓库，将其选为胜出者时所做的提交会被保留。创建分支耗时更长，且等待时间随仓库体积增长。参见 go/jetski-best-of-n。",
